# Walkthrough: Complete Checkout & Payment Flow Implementation

We have upgraded the ordering journey in **FrozenFeast** from `Cart → Place Order` to a complete, secure, four-step flow:

```text
Cart ➔ Checkout ➔ Payment (Razorpay Test Mode / COD) ➔ Order Confirmation
```

All existing features (cart persistence, quantity updates, DineIn, Catering, saved delivery addresses, profile orders history) remain fully intact and backward-compatible.

